12. GIT RULES
=============================================================================

- Commit messages: "type: description (phase X.X)"
  Types: feat, fix, refactor, test, docs, chore
- One logical change per commit.
- NEVER commit __pycache__, *.pyc, *.sqlite, *.db, .env files.
- ALWAYS run tests before committing.

